## Borg type information

borg-type-genericQuad-name = Generic
borg-type-genericQuad-desc = Jack of all trades, master of none. Do various random station tasks, or maybe help out the science department that built you.
borg-type-genericQuad-transponder = generic cyborg

borg-type-engineeringQuad-name = Engineering
